isites. A prerequisite can be a job rank, other successful qualification.",[217,218,220],"h3",{"id":219},"what-elements-are-needed","What elements are needed?",[204,222,223,234,237,240],{},[207,224,225,226],{},"Qualification: Holds all basic infos about the qualification.\n",[204,227,228,231],{},[207,229,230],{},"Access: Holds the access levels to the qualification.",[207,232,233],{},"Requirements: Requirements to be able to take the qualification. -> Don't deny the access to the qualification like access, but are required to send a request or to take the qualification.",[207,235,236],{},"Requests: List of user requests to take the test for the qualification.",[207,238,239],{},"Results: A \"mapping\" of score of an user test.",[207,241,242,243],{},"Tests: Test progress of (started) tests from users.\n",[204,244,245,248,251],{},[207,246,247],{},"Info\u002FConfig of the Test: E.g., how many questions need to be right to pass, how much time do they have, etc.",[207,249,250],{},"Test Questions: Questions for the qualification tests.",[207,252,253],{},"User Test Answers: Answered questions \"waiting for approval\" by a \"trainer\".",[217,255,257],{"id":256},"access-levels","Access Levels",[191,259,260],{},"Similarily structured to documents access levels.",[204,262,263,266,269,272,275,278],{},[207,264,265],{},"Blocked.",[207,267,268],{},"View.",[207,270,271],{},"Request.",[207,273,274],{},"Take.",[207,276,277],{},"Grade.",[207,279,280],{},"Edit.",[199,282,284],{"id":283},"exams","Exams",[191,286,287],{},"3 modes for a qualification with an exam:",[204,289,290,293,296],{},[207,291,292],{},"Disabled.",[207,294,295],{},"Request needed.",[207,297,298],{},"Enabled.",[217,300,302],{"id":301},"flow-request-needed","Flow - Request needed",[304,305,306],"mermaid",{},[307,308,312],"pre",{"className":309,"code":310,"language":304,"meta":311,"style":311},"language-mermaid shiki shiki-themes material-theme-lighter material-theme material-theme-palenight","sequenceDiagram\nUser->>+Qua